WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.646
In under two minutes, you will see how a lighting company gets a profile, and how to manage it.

00:00:05.646 --> 00:00:06.739
We start on the map.

00:00:07.642 --> 00:00:11.032
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:13.023 --> 00:00:15.463
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:15.463 --> 00:00:17.971
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:17.971 --> 00:00:19.327
Tap Use my location.

00:00:21.183 --> 00:00:23.507
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:23.507 --> 00:00:24.190
Tap Allow.

00:00:27.641 --> 00:00:29.023
Tap the season button.

00:00:31.893 --> 00:00:33.995
Tap Thanksgiving and Christmas Lights.

00:00:35.783 --> 00:00:37.030
Search for a home.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:38.802
Type its name, and open it.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:45.015
It says Installed by, with the company's name.

00:00:45.015 --> 00:00:47.575
A check mark means the company confirmed it.

00:00:48.477 --> 00:00:51.171
Tap the company's name to open its profile.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:57.138
If this is your company, claim the profile with your company email.

00:00:57.138 --> 00:00:58.555
Then you manage it here.

00:00:58.555 --> 00:01:01.784
Homes that name your company are listed on the Homes tab.

00:01:02.685 --> 00:01:04.957
Tap Confirm for each home you installed.

00:01:04.957 --> 00:01:06.121
It gets a check mark.

00:01:08.053 --> 00:01:10.097
Next up: Add an event to the map.
